 7. Mullin&#x27;s MAGA backlash 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Illustration: Aïda Amer/Axios. Photo: Al Drago/Getty Images

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Just 4½ months after replacing Kristi Noem as Homeland Security secretary, Markwayne Mullin is feeling the heat from President Trump's MAGA enforcers, Axios' Brittany Gibson reports .

 Steve Bannon , a top MAGA podcaster, is among those who've joined the chorus of MAGA figures objecting to Lance Schroyer's nomination to lead ICE. "You can't pick a cop from Oklahoma and think he's going to walk in and be able to do that, right? You're asking too much of somebody," Bannon told Axios. Keep reading . 

 
 
